SM9pIhulPQpKZ26HYkwkYvy6OF.jpg","genres":["драма","история","музыка"],"overview":"Париж, 1835 год. История о знаменитом композиторе Фредерике Шопене. Он покоряет высшее общество своими концертами, зарабатывает на жизнь уроками и не перестает творить, несмотря на борьбу с тяжелой болезнью. В круговороте приемов и романтических увлечений рождаются его бессмертные шедевры.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1239478","ru":"Begyndelser","en":"Begyndelser","year":"2025","type":"Фильм","rating":7.1,"votes":13,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/3FqMD1AMTfHMUUcKeAJe3Je7mCS.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vMk2Nlx6EBNvP0wp5CCBzbKAo3u.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1221724","ru":"Les Rêveurs","en":"Les Rêveurs","year":"2025","type":"Фильм","rating":7.1,"votes":13,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/6W6nKyFSOcHSX1qq4qDsOR8MaSM.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oT0hoo5V933lWktpE9VdRS0Jxei.jpg","genres":["комедия","драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1182088","ru":"O Melhor Amigo","en":"O Melhor Amigo","year":"2025","type":"Фильм","rating":7.1,"votes":13,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vEhj1fS3hcGgHNEyAEzNi08b1IN.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8rEs7cmAM2rmnqmoIYkpldhyOim.jpg","genres":["драма","мелодрама","музыка"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1122742","ru":"Las sirvientas calientes 8","en":"Las sirvientas calientes 8","year":"2021","type":"Фильм","rating":7.1,"votes":13,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/AtlAKgmgTNyS27ISQHtX5xkpvcU.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/atwL299XAYPwuhoioXUyZ6bnYLT.jpg","genres":["комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1077050","ru":"Menus-Plaisi